      en: ["San-Pédro is the world's largest export port for cocoa beans.", "The modern deep-water port began operations in 1971.", "The city's population was approximately 175,000 at the 2014 census.", "The nearby Taï National Park is a UNESCO World Heritage site.", "San-Pédro is the second most important coastal economic hub after Abidjan.", "The city is a significant center for the timber and fishing industries."],
